# Simplo — Cursor Rules

## Stack
- Next.js 14 App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind, Prisma, NextAuth

## Conventions
- Server Components by default; use "use client" only when needed
- API routes under app/api; always check session + role
- Role helpers live in lib/utils.ts (canCreateProject, canManageDrawing, canEditBreakdown, canManageTimeline, canCheckProgress, canManageUsers)
- Keep UI consistent: slate palette, rounded-xl cards, shared Button/Input/Modal

## Role access (Fase 1)
- ADMIN/PM: create project
- ADMIN only: upload/ganti/hapus denah, plot marker, area plot, deteksi titik
- ADMIN only: tambah/edit detail pekerjaan (breakdown) di titik plotting
- SM/PM: lihat foto + approve (PM tidak isi breakdown / tidak plot)
- SM/LEADER: Leader centang progress; SM approve
- ADMIN/PM/SM: lihat report & kelola absensi (tidak absen mandiri)
- ADMIN only: kelola user
- Semua role: lihat progress

## Fase scope
- Fase 1: Auth, Project CRUD, Floor/drawing, Marker, Breakdown, Progress, Dashboard
- Fase 2 (jangan kerjakan kecuali diminta): Cost, Inventory, Absen, Pekerja, Notifikasi, Blocker

## Mobile (Expo) — docs/rules/expo.md
- Jangan pernah menjalankan `eas build`, `expo run:*`, atau build native apapun sendiri.
- Verifikasi perubahan hanya dengan `npx tsc --noEmit` dan `npx eslint`.
- Jangan generate link download/APK. Hasil dicek lewat Expo Go di HP.
- Wajib sarankan kapan perlu build native vs cukup Expo Go (jangan menunggu diminta).
  - Tidak perlu: UI, warna, teks, logic JS/TS — reload Expo Go.
  - Perlu: native dep, plugin Expo, perubahan native di app.json, SDK bump, fitur di luar Expo Go.
- Kalau ragu, jelaskan kenapa lalu minta konfirmasi sebelum build.
- Stack: Expo SDK 58, Expo Router, React Native, TypeScript.
- Hanya pakai library yang kompatibel dengan Expo Go. Kalau butuh library native di luar itu, tanya dulu.
- Struktur mobile: app/ (routes), components/, lib/ (api client, util), hooks/
